{"ticker":{"symbol":"310210.KQ","name":"보로노이","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":109700.0,"change_pct":-0.05431034482758623,"market_cap":2015532417024.0,"pe":-30.884008,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":375500.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"South Korea","city":"Incheon","employees":169,"website":"https://voronoi.io","business_summary":"Voronoi, Inc. researches, develops, and discovers small molecule kinase inhibitors in South Korea. Its products pipeline includes VRN01, an oral leucine rich repeat kinase 2 inhibitor targeting glioblastoma multiforme to treat brain and pancreatic cancers; VRN07, VRN06, and VRN11 for the treatment of lung cancer; VRN08 and VRN10 to treat breast cancer; and VRN02 for the treatment of rheumatoid arthritis and atopic dermatitis. The company's products pipeline also comprise VRN04-1 to treat autoimmune diseases; VRN04-2 for the treatment of multiple sclerosis and amyotrophic lateral sclerosis; VRN13 to treat pulmonary arterial hypertension; and VRN14 for the treatment of refractory solid cancer. Voronoi, Inc. was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Incheon, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"보로노이(주)는 한국에서 소분자 키나제 억제제를 연구, 개발, 발견합니다. 제품 파이프라인에는 뇌암과 췌장암을 치료하기 위해 다형성 교모세포종을 표적으로 하는 경구용 류신이 풍부한 반복 키나제 2 억제제인 ​​VRN01; 폐암 치료를 위한 VRN07, VRN06 및 VRN11; 유방암 치료를 위한 VRN08 및 VRN10; 류마티스 관절염 및 아토피 피부염 치료를 위한 VRN02. 이 회사의 제품 파이프라인에는 자가면역 질환을 치료하는 VRN04-1도 포함됩니다. 다발성 경화증 및 근위축성 측삭 경화증 치료를 위한 VRN04-2; 폐동맥고혈압을 치료하는 VRN13; 난치성 고형암 치료를 위한 VRN14. 보로노이(Voronoi, Inc.)는 2015년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 인천에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":5500000000.0,"rev_lo":4000000000.0,"rev_hi":7000000000.0,"rev_g":-0.26790002,"n":2,"eps":-4722.5,"eps_lo":-5211.0,"eps_hi":-4234.0,"eps_g":-0.9893},{"period":"2027","rev":13000000000.0,"rev_lo":4000000000.0,"rev_hi":22000000000.0,"rev_g":1.3636,"n":2,"eps":-3552.0,"eps_lo":-5654.0,"eps_hi":-1450.0,"eps_g":0.24790001}],"ltg":null,"